{"module":"path-forward","voice":"male","duration":141.3,"segments":[{"el":"title","text":"The path forward","start":0.0,"end":1.02,"words":[[0.05,0.22],[0.22,0.48],[0.48,0.92]]},{"el":"intro","text":"None of this history was inevitable, and none of it is permanent.","start":1.82,"end":6.22,"words":[[1.87,2.08],[2.08,2.23],[2.23,2.44],[2.44,2.94],[2.94,3.15],[3.15,3.93],[4.18,4.39],[4.39,4.6],[4.6,4.75],[4.75,4.89],[4.89,5.03],[5.03,5.67]]},{"el":"intro","text":"Each of these remedies has a track record, and each has a role for you.","start":6.57,"end":11.16,"words":[[6.62,6.85],[6.85,7.0],[7.0,7.22],[7.22,7.74],[7.74,7.97],[7.97,8.12],[8.12,8.41],[8.41,8.86],[9.12,9.35],[9.35,9.57],[9.57,9.8],[9.8,9.95],[9.95,10.24],[10.24,10.39],[10.39,10.62]]},{"el":"h0","text":"Laws that make harassment costly","start":11.51,"end":14.12,"words":[[11.56,11.84],[11.84,12.13],[12.13,12.5],[12.5,13.35],[13.35,13.92]]},{"el":"s0","text":"San Francisco's CAREN Act, Oregon's 2019 law and California's AB 1775 give targets a remedy.","start":14.82,"end":22.46,"words":[[14.85,15.06],[15.06,15.84],[15.84,16.19],[16.19,16.47],[16.72,17.21],[17.21,18.13],[18.13,18.27],[18.27,18.48],[18.48,19.19],[19.19,19.33],[19.33,20.67],[20.67,20.88],[20.88,21.31],[21.31,21.45],[21.45,21.94]]},{"el":"s0","text":"A federal version would extend that everywhere.","start":22.81,"end":25.61,"words":[[22.86,22.99],[22.99,23.43],[23.43,23.75],[23.75,23.94],[23.94,24.39],[24.39,24.58],[24.58,25.09]]},{"el":"s0","text":"Read and improve the draft, then ask your lawmakers to introduce it.","start":25.96,"end":30.61,"words":[[26.01,26.23],[26.23,26.46],[26.46,26.92],[26.92,27.07],[27.07,27.53],[27.79,28.02],[28.02,28.25],[28.25,28.4],[28.4,29.01],[29.01,29.16],[29.16,29.84],[29.84,30.07]]},{"el":"h1","text":"Different responders","start":31.51,"end":32.92,"words":[[31.56,32.08],[32.08,32.75]]},{"el":"s1","text":"Programs like CAHOOTS (Eugene) and STAR (Denver) send medics and counselors to calls that don't need police.","start":33.62,"end":40.53,"words":[[33.67,34.31],[34.31,34.6],[34.6,35.03],[35.03,35.46],[35.71,35.93],[35.93,36.14],[36.14,36.5],[36.75,37.04],[37.04,37.47],[37.47,37.69],[37.69,38.33],[38.33,38.48],[38.48,38.76],[38.76,38.98],[38.98,39.34],[39.34,39.55],[39.55,39.98]]},{"el":"s1","text":"Ask your city council whether yours has one.","start":40.88,"end":43.86,"words":[[40.92,41.15],[41.15,41.31],[41.31,41.62],[41.62,42.17],[42.17,42.49],[42.49,42.73],[42.73,42.96],[42.96,43.28]]},{"el":"h2","text":"Telling the truth in public","start":44.76,"end":46.9,"words":[[44.81,45.34],[45.34,45.55],[45.55,45.97],[45.97,46.18],[46.18,46.81]]},{"el":"s2","text":"Truth commissions (South Africa 1996, Greensboro 2004–2006, Canada 2008–2015) and memorials like EJI's National Memorial for Peace and Justice in Montgomery put the record where everyone can see it.","start":47.6,"end":65.36,"words":[[47.65,47.97],[47.97,48.63],[48.63,48.95],[48.95,49.44],[49.44,50.92],[51.2,52.02],[52.02,54.23],[54.51,55.0],[55.0,57.13],[57.42,57.66],[57.66,58.48],[58.48,58.81],[58.81,59.13],[59.13,59.7],[59.7,60.44],[60.44,60.6],[60.6,60.85],[60.85,61.09],[61.09,61.67],[61.67,61.83],[61.83,62.65],[62.65,62.89],[62.89,63.06],[63.06,63.47],[63.47,63.71],[63.71,64.28],[64.28,64.53],[64.53,64.69],[64.69,64.94]]},{"el":"s2","text":"Teaching these modules is part of that work.","start":65.71,"end":68.41,"words":[[65.76,66.21],[66.21,66.43],[66.43,66.95],[66.95,67.1],[67.1,67.33],[67.33,67.48],[67.48,67.7],[67.7,68.0]]},{"el":"h3","text":"Repair","start":69.31,"end":70.51,"words":[[69.36,70.26]]},{"el":"s3","text":"The Civil Liberties Act of 1988 apologized and paid $20,000 to each surviving Japanese American who had been incarcerated.","start":71.21,"end":81.62,"words":[[71.27,71.43],[71.43,71.84],[71.84,72.42],[72.42,72.66],[72.66,72.83],[72.83,74.05],[74.05,74.96],[74.96,75.2],[75.2,75.53],[75.53,76.92],[76.92,77.09],[77.09,77.33],[77.33,77.99],[77.99,78.64],[78.64,79.3],[79.3,79.46],[79.46,79.71],[79.71,79.95],[79.95,81.02]]},{"el":"s3","text":"North Carolina and Virginia have compensated sterilization survivors.","start":81.97,"end":87.01,"words":[[82.02,82.24],[82.24,82.89],[82.89,83.11],[83.11,83.69],[83.69,83.9],[83.9,84.77],[84.77,85.78],[85.78,86.43]]},{"el":"s3","text":"Evanston, Illinois, began housing reparations in 2021, California's Reparations Task Force issued its final report in 2023, and H.R.","start":87.36,"end":99.02,"words":[[87.4,88.1],[88.37,88.91],[89.18,89.56],[89.56,90.03],[90.03,90.88],[90.88,91.03],[91.03,92.27],[92.54,93.31],[93.31,94.16],[94.16,94.47],[94.47,94.7],[94.7,95.01],[95.01,95.24],[95.24,95.7],[95.7,96.09],[96.09,96.24],[96.24,97.48],[97.75,97.98],[97.98,98.44]]},{"el":"s3","text":"40 would create a federal commission.","start":99.37,"end":101.74,"words":[[99.42,99.66],[99.66,99.83],[99.83,100.25],[100.25,100.37],[100.37,100.78],[100.78,101.26]]},{"el":"s3","text":"Whether and how to do more is debated; the precedents are documented.","start":102.09,"end":105.95,"words":[[102.13,102.37],[102.37,102.55],[102.55,102.73],[102.73,102.85],[102.85,102.97],[102.97,103.09],[103.09,103.21],[103.21,103.75],[103.96,104.08],[104.08,104.68],[104.68,104.74],[104.74,105.46]]},{"el":"h4","text":"Clearing the books","start":106.85,"end":108.04,"words":[[106.9,107.41],[107.41,107.56],[107.56,107.85]]},{"el":"s4","text":"Segregation-era language still sits in some codes and deeds.","start":108.74,"end":112.64,"words":[[108.76,109.78],[109.78,110.33],[110.33,110.6],[110.6,110.88],[110.88,111.01],[111.01,111.22],[111.22,111.56],[111.56,111.77],[111.77,112.11]]},{"el":"s4","text":"Volunteers can verify old laws and deliver repeal requests, and many states now let homeowners strike covenants from their deeds.","start":112.99,"end":121.86,"words":[[113.04,113.73],[113.73,113.96],[113.96,114.5],[114.5,114.8],[114.8,115.03],[115.03,115.26],[115.26,115.72],[115.72,116.11],[116.11,116.8],[117.07,117.3],[117.3,117.6],[117.6,118.06],[118.06,118.29],[118.29,118.52],[118.52,119.21],[119.21,119.67],[119.67,120.37],[120.37,120.67],[120.67,120.9],[120.9,121.29]]},{"el":"h5","text":"Showing up locally","start":122.76,"end":124.0,"words":[[122.8,123.16],[123.16,123.3],[123.3,123.81]]},{"el":"s5","text":"District attorneys, sheriffs and city councils decide how the police are used, and they are often elected by a few thousand votes.","start":124.7,"end":134.44,"words":[[124.75,125.45],[125.45,126.06],[126.36,126.89],[126.89,127.15],[127.15,127.5],[127.5,128.19],[128.19,128.72],[128.72,128.98],[128.98,129.15],[129.15,129.59],[129.59,129.67],[129.67,130.11],[130.42,130.68],[130.68,130.94],[130.94,131.03],[131.03,131.37],[131.37,131.98],[131.98,132.25],[132.25,132.42],[132.42,132.68],[132.68,133.29],[133.29,133.81]]},{"el":"s5","text":"Register, check your registration, and vote in local elections.","start":134.79,"end":140.38,"words":[[134.84,135.58],[135.87,136.19],[136.19,136.36],[136.36,137.51],[137.79,138.04],[138.04,138.37],[138.37,138.53],[138.53,139.02],[139.02,139.76]]}]}